description	"Nightsister 

Magik wielding casters who utilize enchanted weapons, poison and deception to fell their enemies

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 5% faster RoF
- Nightsister Enchanted Sword (Different Styles Depends On Choice)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Saber Defense (1)
-- Poisons/Low Damage
- Energy Bow (T-21 3)
-- Mag Reload/Primary Only/Staggers/Ignites on hit
- Poison Concoction (Frag 3)
-- Poisons/75% Less Damage
- Nightsister Casting Staff (Clone Rifle 2)
-- 275%+ Damage, 500%- RoF, 60% Less Velocity, Inflict Poison/Slow
-- 5 Concussion Blobs
- Conjure Poison Mist (Poison Thrower)
-- Low Mag Size, Mag Reload/20% Less Damage/RoF

^5Powers:
- Blind (1)
- Mist Push (Push 1)
- Gust Of Wind (Pull 1)
- Magik Pulse (Lightning 1)
- Mind Trick (1)
- Farsight (Sense 1) 
- Magik Enhanced Jump (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 5% more Kb Given
- Dexterity (2) 
- Getup (2)
- Healing (1)
- Assemble (1)
- Aerial Force Regen

^3Abilities:
- Dodge (3) ^3[CS1]
- Agile Roll ^3[CS2]
- Quick Throw Potion (1) ^3[CS3]
- Poison Tipped Darts (6) ^3[CS4]"
